---
import NeoLayout from '../../layouts/NeoLayout.astro';
---
<NeoLayout
 title="About Zilu Rane — Full-Stack Engineer & Technical Lead"
 description="Learn about Zilu Rane, a Pune-based full-stack engineer and Technical Lead working with JavaScript, React, Node.js, Java, cloud systems and AI workflows."
 canonical="https://zilu.dev/about/"
 schema={{'@type':'ProfilePage',name:'About Zilu Rane',url:'https://zilu.dev/about/',mainEntity:{'@id':'https://zilu.dev/#person'}}}
>
 <div class="site-width neo-page">
   <nav class="neo-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">About</span></nav>
   <header class="neo-intro">
     <div class="neo-intro-copy">
       <p class="neo-overline">THE PERSON BEHIND THE CODE / 03</p>
       <h1 class="neo-h1">Hi, I'm <span class="neo-highlight blue">Zilu.</span></h1>
       <p class="neo-lede">I care about thoughtful engineering: building systems that are useful, maintainable and pleasant to work with.</p>
     </div>
     <div class="neo-issue blue" aria-hidden="true"><b>9+</b><span>YEARS BUILDING</span></div>
   </header>
   <div class="neo-feature-strip" aria-label="Engineering interests">
     <div class="neo-feature"><span>01 / MY WORK</span><b>Full-stack engineering</b></div>
     <div class="neo-feature"><span>02 / MY FOCUS</span><b>Architecture & AI</b></div>
     <div class="neo-feature"><span>03 / MY INTEREST</span><b>Mentoring & open source</b></div>
   </div>
   <div class="neo-article-layout">
     <div class="neo-card neo-panel neo-reading">
       <p class="neo-overline">ABOUT ME</p>
       <h2 class="neo-section-heading">Software should make sense.</h2>
       <p>I'm a Pune-based Technical Lead at Accion Labs, with 9+ years of development and automation-testing experience. I work across React, Node.js, Angular, React Native, cloud platforms and AI workflows such as LangChain and retrieval-augmented generation.</p>
       <p>I previously worked at e-Zest (which was acquired by Accion Labs), Larsen & Toubro Infotech and LifeCOMPILERS. My public projects include Cloudflare Workers automation, event-driven microservices and open-source integrations.</p>
       <h2>How I approach engineering</h2>
       <p>I prefer practical architecture, readable code, sensible performance trade-offs, and tools that solve real problems. I enjoy experimenting with AI workflows and sharing what I learn along the way.</p>
       <h2>Outside the code</h2>
       <p>I enjoy mentoring, writing technical notes and contributing to developer communities.</p>
       <div class="neo-meta-line">
         <a href="/projects/" class="btn primary">See my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
         <a href="/resume/" class="btn">View resume ↗</a>
       </div>
     </div>
     <aside class="neo-sidebar" aria-label="About and contact links">
       <section class="neo-card neo-person-card">
         <div class="neo-portrait-wrap"><img src="/images/zilu-portrait-2026-hd.webp" width="960" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Portrait of Zilu Rane"/></div>
         <div class="neo-person-caption"><strong>Zilu Rane</strong><span>ENGINEER · BUILDER · MENTOR</span></div>
       </section>
       <section class="neo-card">
         <h2>Find me online</h2>
         <p>Conversations about full-stack engineering, developer tooling and AI.</p>
         <div class="neo-contact-links">
           <a href="https://github.com/zilurrane" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
           <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/zilurane" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
           <a href="https://dev.to/zilurrane" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DEV Community <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
         </div>
       </section>
     </aside>
   </div>
   <section class="neo-card neo-cta" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
     <div><h2 id="contact-title">Want to build something together?</h2><p>For engineering conversations, collaboration or an interesting idea.</p></div>
     <a href="mailto:zilurrane@gmail.com" class="btn">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
   </section>
 </div>
</NeoLayout>
